POST {{baseUrl}}/workspace-requests
...headers

{
  "title": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "urlName": "title-too-long",
  "pikudId": 1,
  "managers": ["s9336069"]
}

?? status == 400

### Create Workspace Request — urlName over 50 chars (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspace-requests
...headers

{
  "title": "שם כתובת ארוך",
  "urlName": "bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb",
  "pikudId": 1,
  "managers": ["s9336069"]
}

?? status == 400

