### Update Workspace Request — invalid status enum (expect 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/workspace-requests/{{workspaceRequestId}}
...headers

{
  "status": "MAYBE"
}

?? status == 400

### Update Workspace Request — details only, no status (merges into details JSON)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/workspace-requests/{{workspaceRequestId}}
...headers

{
  "title": "{{patchTitle}}",
  "urlName": "{{patchUrlName}}"
}

?? status == 200

### Update Workspace Request — status stays PENDING, no decision notification
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/workspace-requests/{{workspaceRequestId}}
...headers

{
  "status": "PENDING"
}

?? status == 200

### Update Workspace Request — reject without a decline message (expect 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/workspace-requests/{{workspaceRequestId}}
...headers

{
  "status": "REJECTED"
}

?? status == 400

### Update Workspace Request — reject with a decline message
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/workspace-requests/{{workspaceRequestId}}
...headers

{
  "status": "REJECTED",
  "declineMessage": "שם הסביבה אינו תקין"
}

?? status == 200

### Update Workspace Request — re-reject is not a new decision (expect 200, no notification)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/workspace-requests/{{workspaceRequestId}}
...headers

{
  "status": "REJECTED",
  "declineMessage": "סיבה מעודכנת"
}

?? status == 200

